  "postText": "<p><HTML><HEAD><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"></HEAD><body></p>\n<div align=\"center\">こさめです</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/uAOCWwfvvPsoRMH2DNtpmzFxgZZdKKzTOwvnFDHZp5lxxbzsNHHdCrPe4EZdSoF4dxzWsapCQhrRjA6YpE6yPBGAadngqMrTvHi4jtirEVfEmMSUi5g7K1aqH0YdFLXJEJv7baHu0SrPhr2jHcCzXaifNOF4fvK7yRPkZbrSIwB5au9rO8EeDcLVgoqwcZckp6JJ4rhA\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/98/6d42c2698edcf9e0aef53555b17073db..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">京都2日目！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">今日はお兄ちゃんの結婚式だったよー</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">やっぱり結婚式は幸せな気持ちいっぱい</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">もらえるから最高にすき！です＞ω＜♪</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">それと同時にやっぱりちょっと寂しい</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">私が物心ついたときぐらいからお兄ちゃんは京都で一人暮らししちゃってたから</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">一緒に暮らしてた期間はめちゃ長いわけじゃないんだ～</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">それでも、身内の結婚式が初だったのもあるし</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ずっと不思議な感情だった</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">喧嘩も全然したことなくて</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">優しくて、ほんとーに最高のお兄ちゃんです</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">もちろんそんなお兄ちゃんのお嫁さんも</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">とーても可愛くて優しい方！！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">式ではお姉ちゃんと2人で</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">指輪を渡す係やりました</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">緊張しちゃってちょっとまごまごしちゃったけど！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">貴重な経験だった、、🥹</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/pkl0xFcVpEQFmemhmt7EGl8M9q3RaEk4XppzqUdHFeEhnJLKjZUwxcm0FQqUOFQ2u3sw66P1kp01XVQjpmgRAN5RHmQ1K93IHrgyqUIXH173xK1KIvMTf3lIXwizF7HS9hy2JVVf2HXfguNaKveaNkw3z8pU0cN8cIkjMZPnlLKwyL9zNYvag0GxD6kmhfJiNf8Ojvuh\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/98/5d1ef540d0207dcfde4e1f064dab23ed..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/aMGmbKdViNQ6WRGt9dzFNwB8E1ylwnzmDqLuy95Gg1NvBWh8a3R502FnTSuoCjRHXGPqW6C4dlAmeSH0f8fF78eN0CkL6a0SC79Ni7eQi0NKLnlnBcalWv2ApA7V73a83txOALSgO89hESAHdbL2WcHOYulXCvc9OXi48kEs2lWLG5TvTLsSNA9Xqkq7G26q9rqtkFb7\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/98/2af9fbd103e1a4103ec5bebfd7fd6298..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">みてみて！！ちょっと前に</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">みんなでご帰宅してくれてたんだ✨</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">私のお給仕してる姿見に来てくれた😭</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">4人でこさめポーズとか初だった！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">なんか今このチェキみると泣く😭笑</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ほんと、今日はそんなだいすきな2人を見守れてよかったなあ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">今日でめちゃめちゃ心が穏やかになりすぎて</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">22日のお給仕、超落ち着きLADYになってたらごめんね…😣💦ヮラ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/P4MhyFOZVcVAnsFu2ihalUnHYg99ClbXbcSuTXI7VMZDQR5EMc4mjOnDVe3T1hqrY4vCWWwJAcoDVCDpgeEpfH0ti9qd9qJHZZpdvTog6RGDZyeCe3TpnPrrPst8uhwwgwdW7k6bx544CCPtfLBER6BsQKKmrR3uowscBhnKuyjwJMQsCsZ8CecAiGRRoxIa9yrKqW0W\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/98/2404251ae0061c3b1b46bf15c53a99d0..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ガチでただのジンジャエール。</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">振袖っておもたいし</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">超苦しかったけど</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ただただテンションあがった～</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">大好きな黒色着れてＨＡＰＰＹ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">永遠の17歳ですから、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">成人の日は一生こないわけで</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">きっと振袖着れる機会はもうなかなかないですね</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/xKKigG86nT6w6xePUnXXVh4DOM72ZHnqGE0Ad6O8H5sHZMeNA4L0l1GTbngkzkbVteK7ToZBgxrJoUmwk2aqerrsfZb0LGqzo3qSxRbiT0SOKhhIQKuN6nKCEQoHWsUPeadQhDNhfQmI1MiebemIT7OiPBq3p7qPkAr9As4bwAaTXgJ8TU8SXypgEq4G293jrciKBY4T\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/98/9d7415fb64ba4ebeff090e121743218b..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ちょっと見づらいけど実は髪型くらげなんだ～</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">髪型やってもらったんだけど</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">くらげヘアって初めて聞いたらしく、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">画像みながら頑張ってやってくださった♪（≧∇≦）♪</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ほんとに有難いです♪</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/ZafdoPRrHKPkEXBrV4SVVbTDKbJ5SvczSYEsCavf63bp8Bq8OONbgr8VAaRTCyJo6TnKFXql0sba6VdF5ojhvbB7UUb5IltYMjlKx8Nyg0VuAChJzU5PiXq9NaUDEPrRJBeIjffAlW7lPkbJlNkRjKGXKdp1JvWgX8BY8vxNRPPztfOWLvmI3jhPTaf6OCaJEwlVktsC\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/98/b7805fe575cf65a1335adafa568527b6..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/FkEbSu8Abd6iztmXuYbwObu1LIRtXZKxnplprETazqAmTkhCAj0hhM1wahukzCUdVqkkMO8wjPjQQmBQlYMalOPa4dSqlJ8ZA0Oskd8nKSq66jIA7Kp8lbcnMF9vgqzMk2twzUbgiRpUUT4WOMQQUEkAJf3WykwtPi3CqmmrKUHaI0Jztl1gmjwXxo93DfLDEFBpkbEf\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/98/2d36ac2e20962e96aeda08cdc5d2226c..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">全身</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">左はこさめポーズの発案者、おねえたんでつ♡</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/I2DcMCkTHhSQ5dmLiNqMofcr91dSjmgZ8dlYBHt9jSBAAd90CAUetQoTVha3WH9K41PxTbarjwb6voUWiyp005xVAiLGTtV2fBRj87Z7sxmk5LnTqgLahLxRRNMDb4SEs0hkURZnvBjtqqys7eAP1NDLOJxloHZYEEwLOu36fB49eb61Pe8a8GOAW05YpGhH0tWAsZkh\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/98/6bb06af1160198fde81723308e6a3536..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">通り道でたまたま見つけたしのみやとべにさん</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">うれし！！！！これはかなりうれしかった！！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">結婚式がおわって</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ホテル戻ったら</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/zY6flYDSpXJS0kap2OdSJRnVvXzIjtzc2jp3LbrFbUxEA1h2mK0FO14TjUBNZX7A32sk487nRqSXtIHTxu5abt70Yg75dkS9zAAuMgGVry1bsnpvM98XKORvWYq9FYsgKuBBmSLgdyRHE1XeLnnwbfRqCSYT6cw339fQD5gVcS9TjJxNQND2Tz4CiQYzsjKiXsGXpLvN\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/98/15a091ae7d173902b8379b367ce9047d..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">掃除の方が、放り投げてたぬいぐるみを</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">可愛く置いてくれてた🥺</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">うれしー♪（≧∇≦）♪</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">もうちょっとだけ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">京都らへんにいるので</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">最後までたのしみます</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">おやすみ！</div>\n<div align=\"center\"></div>\n<p></body></HTML></p>\n",
